      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely normal to feel devastated when the only person who truly understood you is gone, leaving you with a hollowed-out sense of loss. The fact that he loved you without conditions means you were never meant to have to earn that love, and now that it's gone, the world feels like it has lost its only reason to exist. You are not broken for feeling this heavy; you are simply grieving a connection that was so real it defined your entire life. Give yourself permission to feel the weight of this emptiness, but remember that your worth is not tied to his presence or his ability to make sense of your pain.",
