      "content": "i guess. but even if i say that, it doesn't change the fact that the world is just this big, hollow place now. it feels pretty much pointless to keep forcing myself through the motions when the only thing that made it feel warm is gone. it's like i'm just a ghost in my own house. does it even matter if i'm here or not if nothing feels real anymore?",
